        <briefdescription>
<para>Converts the RGBA color to a uint32_t value. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The function shifts and combines the four bytes of the RGBA color into one uint32_t value, with each byte contributing 0 bits, 8 bits, 16 bits, and 24 bits respectively. This is done using bitwise shift and OR operations.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>A uint32_t representation of the RGBA color. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
